Package: zypper-declarative
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Declarative, reconciling converger surfaced as a zypper subcommand
 zypper-declarative converges a SUSE system to a desired manifest (the
 declarable subset of the SUSE Machinery system description: packages,
 repositories, services, and /etc config files) inside a single snapshot
 transaction, recording what was applied. It provides the verbs apply, diff,
 verify, status, and describe. It performs no direct network I/O of its own;
 all package retrieval is delegated to the package manager against declared,
 pinned, signed repositories.
